6 10.8528L20.9009 26.037Z\" fill=\"#4DCEA7\" stroke=\"#4DCEA7\" stroke-width=\"1.817\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAnd much more...\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>$450 Per Day</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://meetings-na2.hubspot.com/marketing-1/paradise-passport-\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBook Now\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/f7b2adff-9e6f5667.mp4<p><strong>Introducing the Paradise Passport</strong> – an exciting new offering that grants you access to our serene and rejuvenating environment for shorter visits. Whether you're seeking a quick escape or an introduction to a new lifestyle, the Paradise Passport allows you to structure your stay exactly as you wish, free from predefined schedules.</p><p>Enjoy the freedom to explore our world-class facilities, indulge in our organic plant-based cuisine, and immerse yourself in a tranquil setting designed to nurture your body, mind, and spirit. This flexible option is perfect for those looking to experience the benefits of our progressive wellness approach outside of our structured health programs.</p><p>If you're new to the Hippocrates lifestyle, the Paradise Passport is also an ideal way to introduce yourself – as well as your friends and family – to our globally leading center of health and wellness for 7 decades.</p><p>Available to <a href=\"https://app.mews.com/distributor/7e598037-91cd-42f8-aa43-b1690146747d\" target=\"blank\">book online</a> or purchase at the front desk, sales office, or spa.</p><p><small>(Services are subject to availability and may be swapped with an item of same or lesser value for no additional cost or upgraded for a fee.)</small></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Wellness <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/your.png\"> Way</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Embrace the freedom to explore our offerings without the requirement of structured services. While those on the Paradise Passport are invited to partake in our many offerings, they are not mandatory, leaving you free to chart your own course of relaxation and exploration.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Hear from some of our previous guests &amp; <strong>their life changing journeys</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t[grw id=634]\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Experience wellness your way</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://meetings-na2.hubspot.com/marketing-1/paradise-passport-\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBook Now\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Embark on Your Journey</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<main></main><p>With the Paradise Passport, embark on a journey where the discovery of self and the exploration of holistic wellbeing are yours to command. It's more than a visit; it's an invitation to transform amidst the beauty of our nature-immersed sanctuary. Join us at Hippocrates Wellness, where every step on our grounds is a step towards a more vibrant, healthful, and enlightened you.</p><footer id=\"footer\"></footer>", "seoTitle": null, "seoDesc": null, "canonical": null, "ogTitle": null, "ogDesc": null, "image": null, "terms": {}, "elementor": true}